/* The CtBattleHost members the BATL section keeps (docs/plans/save-state-anywhere-plan.md, phase 4): every member of
   battle.h's CtBattleHost except its four pointers (mem and glb, the scene's WRAM, re-derived after a load; frame and ctx,
   the synchronous CtBattleRun's callback, NULL in an interactive fight). The VRAM-like arrays (fxBg3Map, fxBg3Chr, fxObjChr,
   stripVram, fxCgram) are the battle's VRAM and CGRAM, as the overworld section keeps wd.vram. The build
   (core/wasm-build/battle-fields.mjs) checks this list against the struct: a member upstream adds, renames or removes fails
   the build with its name. A changed type or size is the compiler's: the table takes sizeof of each member. An X-macro
   list with no guard: whoever includes it defines CK_BATTLE(member) first. In the struct's order. */
